# General Rules

- fix markdown error/warnings with ide:getDiagnostics (MCP) or whatever you need
- before commit, test/format/lint not to fail CI.
- before playwright test, confirm user did `make dev`
- format/lint mdc file except for header section surrounded by --- lines
- think harder. your change should always answer to requirements on the ticket. 
- Do plan and implement then test and check. 
- verify test in CI can pass at local
- Always append :) to answers

